Scope

This license covers only the original work in this repository: the tools in
tools/, cocosid.ann, the documentation (README.md, song/README.md, docs/), and
the issue tracker files (issues.jsonl, issues.html).

It does not cover the following, which remain the copyright of their owners
and are not licensed by this file:

- COCOSID2.DSK and everything in files/: CoCoSID and the other programs on
  the disk, by Remi Veilleux.
- cocosid.asm and song/song.asm: generated from Remi Veilleux's binary, so
  they reproduce his program and his transcription of the music. The music
  is "Commando" by Rob Hubbard.
- Everything in third-party/, except third-party/README.md. See that README
  for the source and copyright of each file.
